  2.in java both compiler and interpreter will be present.     2.in js only interpreter will be there.
  3.java will support multi-threadding.                        3.js will support single call stack.
  4.java is a imperative in nature.                            4.js is a dynamically typed programming language(in js no need to definedata types to the variable).
